.TH KLIPPIX-RESET-PASSWORD 8 "July 2026" "Klippix .510 BETA" "System Administration"
.SH NAME
klippix-reset-password \- reset the Klippix web password
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B klippix-reset-password
.RI [ --random ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B klippix-reset-password
updates the Nginx password file used to protect the Klippix web interface.
Run it without arguments from a terminal to enter a new password interactively.
The
.B --random
option generates a new password and prints it once.
.PP
The web username is
.BR klippix .
After updating the password, the command validates and reloads Nginx.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /etc/klippix/htpasswd
Nginx password database.
.TP
.I /etc/klippix/initial-password
Root-readable initial password, removed after an interactive reset.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR htpasswd (1),
.BR nginx (8)
